OL,3,GNEWSAGas explosion accused 'acted with
OL,4,Agross disregard'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn their closing remarks today, lawyers
OL,7,Ffor the prosecution said the three men
OL,8,Fhad been "careless" and had "acted with
OL,9,Fa gross disregard for clear risk of
OL,10,Fdeath".
